/api.github.com/users/Copilot/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Pull request overview\n\nThis pull request adds integration tests to verify the fix for issue #2967, where ACL groups containing deleted or unknown users would break connectivity for valid users. The fix ensures that the policy manager is updated immediately when a user is deleted, preventing stale policy state from breaking connectivity when groups contain references to non-existent users.\n\n**Changes:**\n- Added `DeleteUser` method to the integration test control interface and implementation in `hsic`\n- Updated `DeleteUser` in state management to return a change signal and trigger policy manager updates\n- Added 5 comprehensive integration tests covering various scenarios of unknown/deleted users in ACL groups\n- Added unit test to verify `DeleteUser` returns proper change signal\n\n### Reviewed changes\n\nCopilot reviewed 7 out of 7 changed files in this pull request and generated 3 comments.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Show a summary per file</summary>\n\n| File | Description |\r\n| ---- | ----------- |\r\n| integration/hsic/hsic.go | Added `DeleteUser` method to enable user deletion in integration tests |\r\n| integration/control.go | Added `DeleteUser` method to `ControlServer` interface |\r\n| integration/acl_test.go | Added 5 integration tests covering unknown/deleted user scenarios in ACL groups |\r\n| hscontrol/state/state.go | Modified `DeleteUser` to return change signal and update policy manager immediately |\r\n| hscontrol/grpcv1_test.go | Added unit test to verify `DeleteUser` returns proper change signal |\r\n| hscontrol/grpcv1.go | Updated to use change signal returned from `DeleteUser` instead of manually creating one |\r\n| .github/workflows/test-integration.yaml | Added new tests to CI workflow |\n</details>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n---\n\n💡 <a href=\"/juanfont/headscale/new/main/.github/instructions?filename=*.instructions.md\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Add Copilot custom instructions</a> for smarter, more guided reviews. <a href=\"https://docs.github.com/en/copilot/customizing-copilot/adding-repository-custom-instructions-for-github-copilot\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Learn how to get started</a>.","commit_id":"38bd919cbfe41c541c142ea57ba6278c5ce732e6","state":"commented","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/3014#pullrequestreview-3669687431","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/3014","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/3014#pullrequestreview-3669687431"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/3014"}},"submitted_at":"2026-01-16T09:12:40Z","updated_at":"2026-01-16T09:12:40Z","author_association":"NONE","event":"reviewed"},{"id":22091664301,"node_id":"HRFPE_lADOEFLz887jOPhGzwAAAAUkxAut","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/events/22091664301","actor":{"login":"kradalby","id":98431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4NDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby","html_url":"https://github.com/kradalby","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"head_ref_force_pushed","commit_id":"42032ee6b50a2d6c73b31ff66eaa3b28c4c356c6","commit_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kradalby/headscale/commits/42032ee6b50a2d6c73b31ff66eaa3b28c4c356c6","created_at":"2026-01-16T10:01:05Z","performed_via_github_app":null},{"id":22095701166,"node_id":"RTE_lADOEFLz887jOPhGzwAAAAUlAaSu","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/events/22095701166","actor":{"login":"kradalby","id":98431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4NDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby","html_url":"https://github.com/kradalby","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"renamed","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2026-01-16T13:20:24Z","rename":{"from":"integration: add tests for ACL group with deleted/unknown users","to":"state: update policy manager when deleting users"},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"sha":"e9cac60ae37deac4a4226379ff78523869f4ac45","node_id":"C_kwDOEFLz89oAKGU5Y2FjNjBhZTM3ZGVhYzRhNDIyNjM3OWZmNzg1MjM4NjlmNGFjNDU","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/e9cac60ae37deac4a4226379ff78523869f4ac45","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/e9cac60ae37deac4a4226379ff78523869f4ac45","author":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-01-09T15:15:26Z"},"committer":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-01-16T13:58:04Z"},"tree":{"sha":"4dd5a89f480edbf2ceb9939ee12cf0472b9cbc24","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/4dd5a89f480edbf2ceb9939ee12cf0472b9cbc24"},"message":"integration: add tests for ACL group with deleted/unknown users\n\nAdd DeleteUser method to ControlServer interface and implement it in\nHeadscaleInContainer to enable testing user deletion scenarios.\n\nAdd two integration tests for issue #2967:\n- TestACLGroupWithUnknownUser: tests that valid users can communicate\n  when a group references a non-existent user\n- TestACLGroupAfterUserDeletion: tests connectivity after deleting a\n  user that was referenced in an ACL group\n\nThese tests currently pass but don't fully reproduce the reported issue\nwhere deleted users break connectivity for the entire group.\n\nUpdates #2967","parents":[{"sha":"e43f19df794158328729c47f479069ec4fdafaf8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/e43f19df794158328729c47f479069ec4fdafaf8","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/e43f19df794158328729c47f479069ec4fdafaf8"}],"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null},"event":"committed"},{"sha":"19185a9a2333dde780b9844b5264ea0cd12bd703","node_id":"C_kwDOEFLz89oAKDE5MTg1YTlhMjMzM2RkZTc4MGI5ODQ0YjUyNjRlYTBjZDEyYmQ3MDM","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/19185a9a2333dde780b9844b5264ea0cd12bd703","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/19185a9a2333dde780b9844b5264ea0cd12bd703","author":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-01-09T15:31:59Z"},"committer":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-01-16T13:58:56Z"},"tree":{"sha":"ba8de7144e50fc1a7cbf3be36b850fd594a8912f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/ba8de7144e50fc1a7cbf3be36b850fd594a8912f"},"message":"state: update policy manager when deleting users\n\nMake DeleteUser call updatePolicyManagerUsers() to refresh the policy\nmanager's cached user list after user deletion. This ensures consistency\nwith CreateUser, UpdateUser, and RenameUser which all update the policy\nmanager.\n\nPreviously, DeleteUser only removed the user from the database without\nupdating the policy manager. This could leave stale user references in\nthe cached user list, potentially causing issues when policy is\nre-evaluated.\n\nThe gRPC handler now uses the change returned from DeleteUser instead of\nmanually constructing change.UserRemoved().\n\nFixes #2967","parents":[{"sha":"e9cac60ae37deac4a4226379ff78523869f4ac45","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/e9cac60ae37deac4a4226379ff78523869f4ac45","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/e9cac60ae37deac4a4226379ff78523869f4ac45"}],"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null},"event":"committed"},{"sha":"683abb28c57cb1ae8f1bbcbc83610455ef0a8fe2","node_id":"C_kwDOEFLz89oAKDY4M2FiYjI4YzU3Y2IxYWU4ZjFiYmNiYzgzNjEwNDU1ZWYwYThmZTI","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/683abb28c57cb1ae8f1bbcbc83610455ef0a8fe2","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/683abb28c57cb1ae8f1bbcbc83610455ef0a8fe2","author":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-01-14T08:52:58Z"},"committer":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-01-16T13:58:56Z"},"tree":{"sha":"c7ebba3aa4fd61c330c038a17c2db3cf0c38764e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/c7ebba3aa4fd61c330c038a17c2db3cf0c38764e"},"message":"ci: add ACL unknown user tests to integration workflow\n\nUpdates #2967","parents":[{"sha":"19185a9a2333dde780b98